OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks refund for stalled
OL,4,Ashake-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council says it will ask the
OL,7,Fgovernment to reimburse money it spent
OL,8,Fas part of stalled plans for
OL,9,Freorganising local government.
OL,11,FIn September, plans which would have
OL,12,Fseen smaller councils replaced with
OL,13,Flarger local authorities were put on
OL,14,Fhold after complaints from councils
OL,15,Facross the country.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
